    "created_at": "2018-06-07T06:14:43Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-06-07T06:14:43Z",
    "body": "I wonder if the recording should actually happen in the OS actions that eventually lead to dispatching of the event. I think that would probably more closely match actual implementations as they wouldn't want to run the dispatch algorithm normally (they optimize it away by knowing there are no listeners).\r\n\r\nThe main problem with this of course is that we don't have solid OS action definitions anywhere, so perhaps we need to accept this as a temporary workaround and note it as such.",
